{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07300","headline":"题灵佑上人法华院木兰花 · 刘长卿","name":"题灵佑上人法华院木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭种南中树，年华几度新。\n已依初地长，独发旧园春。\n映日成华盖，摇风散锦茵。\n色空荣落处，香醉往来人。\n菡萏千灯遍，芳菲一雨均。\n高柯傥爲檝，渡海有良因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}